---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="church-footer py-5 mt-5">
  <div class="container px-4 px-lg-5">
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
          <img
            src="/assets/Icons/logo-jki-ms-96.png"
            alt="Logo JKI Mawar Saron"
            width="44"
            height="44"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="me-2"
          />
          <span class="h5 mb-0 text-white fw-bold">JKI MAWAR SARON</span>
        </div>
        <p class="small text-secondary mb-3" style="line-height: 1.7;">
          Gereja lokal yang menghadirkan kemuliaan, kasih, dan kuasa Kerajaan Allah yang seutuhnya di luar empat dinding gereja.
        </p>
        <p class="small text-secondary mb-1">
          <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt text-warning me-2"></i>
          Jl. Widosari Raya No. 15, Brumbungan, Semarang 50135
        </p>
        <p class="small text-secondary mb-0">
          <i class="fas fa-envelope text-warning me-2"></i>
          jkimawarsaron@gmail.com
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
        <p class="h6 text-white text-uppercase fw-bold mb-3" style="letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Jadwal Ibadah</p>
        <ul class="list-unstyled small text-secondary mb-0" style="line-height: 2;">
          <li><strong class="text-white">Sunday Service:</strong> Minggu 09.00 WIB</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white">Impact Kids:</strong> Minggu 09.00 WIB</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white">Youth Impact:</strong> Minggu 11.00 WIB</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white">Doa Bersama:</strong> Sesuai jadwal komunitas</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-2 col-md-6">
        <p class="h6 text-white text-uppercase fw-bold mb-3" style="letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Tautan Cepat</p>
        <ul class="list-unstyled small mb-0" style="line-height: 2;">
          <li><a href="/ourstory">Our Story</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ministry">Pelayanan</a></li>
          <li><a href="/christ-community">Christ Community</a></li>
          <li><a href="/shermon">Khotbah & Media</a></li>
          <li><a href="/events">Agenda Acara</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
        <p class="h6 text-white text-uppercase fw-bold mb-3" style="letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Media & Pastoral</p>
        <p class="small text-secondary mb-3">
          Ikuti siaran ibadah, renungan mingguan, dan informasi kegiatan gereja melalui kanal resmi kami.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex gap-3 mb-3">
          <a
            href="https://www.instagram.com/jkimawarsaron.smg/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="Instagram JKI Mawar Saron"
            class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle"
            style="width: 40px; height: 40px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);"
          >
            <i class="fab fa-instagram text-white"></i>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://www.youtube.com/@JKIMawarSaronSemarang/featured"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="YouTube JKI Mawar Saron"
            class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle"
            style="width: 40px; height: 40px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);"
          >
            <i class="fab fa-youtube text-white"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="my-4" style="border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

    <div class="row align-items-center">
      <div class="col-md-6 text-center text-md-start">
        <p class="small text-secondary mb-0">
          &copy; {currentYear} <span class="text-white fw-bold">JKI MAWAR SARON</span>. Seluruh hak cipta dilindungi.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 text-center text-md-end mt-2 mt-md-0">
        <p class="small text-secondary mb-0">
          Semarang, Jawa Tengah, Indonesia
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
